{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"سنن النسائي","section":{"37":"The Book of Fighting [The Prohibition of Bloodshed]"},"section_detail":{"37":{"hadithnumber_first":3966,"hadithnumber_last":4132,"arabicnumber_first":3966,"arabicnumber_last":4132,"name_native":"كتاب القتال [تحريم الدماء]"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4107,"arabicnumber":4107,"text":"اخبرنا احمد بن حرب، قال حدثنا سفيان بن عيينة، عن ابي الزعراء، عن عمه ابي الاحوص، عن عبد الله، قال سباب المسلم فسوق وقتاله كفر","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Mauquf"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Mauquf"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":37,"hadith":142}}]}